{"title": "Sword of the Silverlight", "pageid": 24436, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sword_of_the_Silverlight", "categories": ["Pages with unknown creatures", "Class actions", "Actions", "Summoning actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sword_of_the_Silverlight.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Sword_of_the_Silverlight.webp/300px-Sword_of_the_Silverlight.webp, /w/images/8/8f/Sword_of_the_Silverlight.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Sword_of_the_Silverlight.webp/300px-Sword_of_the_Silverlight.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Sword_of_the_Silverlight.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Sword of the Silverlight</b> is a unique class action only available during the <a href=\"/wiki/Confront_the_Elder_Brain\" title=\"Confront the Elder Brain\">Confront the Elder Brain</a> quest. It allows the party to summon <a href=\"/wiki/Dame_Aylin\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dame Aylin\">Dame Aylin</a> to aid them in battle.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Summon Dame Aylin, <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">Selûne's</a> shining paladin, to join your side in battle. \n</p>\n<span style=\"color: white;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">Dismissed after combat until re-summoned.</span><br><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">Can't be summoned again if killed in combat.</span></span><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_END_AllyAbility_NightsongSummon</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_END_AllyAbility_NightsongSummon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_END_AllyAbility_NightsongSummon\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetCharacter_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetCharacter (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetCharacter</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetItems_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetItems (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetItems</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IgnoreVisionBlock_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IgnoreVisionBlock (spell flag)\">IgnoreVisionBlock</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsLinkedSpellContainer_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsLinkedSpellContainer (spell flag)\">IsLinkedSpellContainer</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Wildshape_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Wildshape (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">Wildshape</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creature:_Aylin\"> Creature: Aylin </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p>[[ Aylin\n</p>\n]]<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-hrule nomobile\" style=\"user-select: none;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><img src=\"/w/images/b/be/Bg3_content_hr.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"460\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Bg3_content_hr.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>Dame Aylin is equipped with a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Greatsword_%2B1\" title=\"Greatsword +1\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Greatsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Greatsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Greatsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Greatsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Greatsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Greatsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Greatsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Greatsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Greatsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Greatsword_%2B1\" title=\"Greatsword +1\">Greatsword +1</a>, dealing a total of <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">2d6 + 5</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a> damage. Her great sword has the regular actions: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Main_Hand_Attack\" title=\"Main Hand Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp/38px-Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Main Hand Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Hand_Attack\" title=\"Main Hand Attack\">Main Hand Attack</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cleave\" title=\"Cleave\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp/25px-Cleave_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp/38px-Cleave_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp/50px-Cleave_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cleave\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp/25px-Cleave_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cleave\" title=\"Cleave\">Cleave</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pommel_Strike\" title=\"Pommel Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Pommel_Strike_Icon.webp/25px-Pommel_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Pommel_Strike_Icon.webp/38px-Pommel_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Pommel_Strike_Icon.webp/50px-Pommel_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pommel Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Pommel_Strike_Icon.webp/25px-Pommel_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Pommel_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pommel_Strike\" title=\"Pommel Strike\">Pommel Strike</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lacerate\" title=\"Lacerate\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp/25px-Lacerate_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp/38px-Lacerate_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp/50px-Lacerate_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lacerate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp/25px-Lacerate_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lacerate\" title=\"Lacerate\">Lacerate</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-hrule nomobile\" style=\"user-select: none;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><img src=\"/w/images/b/be/Bg3_content_hr.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"460\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Bg3_content_hr.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abjure_Enemy\" title=\"Abjure Enemy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Abjure_Enemy_Icon.webp/40px-Abjure_Enemy_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Abjure_Enemy_Icon.webp/60px-Abjure_Enemy_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Abjure_Enemy_Icon.webp/80px-Abjure_Enemy_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Abjure Enemy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Abjure_Enemy_Icon.webp/40px-Abjure_Enemy_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b8/Abjure_Enemy_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Abjure_Enemy\" title=\"Abjure Enemy\">Abjure Enemy</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> + <span aria-label=\"Channel Oath Charge\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Channel_Oath_Icon.png/20px-Channel_Oath_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Channel_Oath_Icon.png/30px-Channel_Oath_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Channel_Oath_Icon.png/40px-Channel_Oath_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Channel Oath Charge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Channel_Oath_Icon.png/20px-Channel_Oath_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4a/Channel_Oath_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abjure_Enemy:_Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Abjure Enemy: Frightened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Abjure_Enemy_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Abjure_Enemy_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Abjure_Enemy_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Abjure_Enemy_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Abjure_Enemy_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Abjure_Enemy_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frighten\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Abjure_Enemy_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Abjure_Enemy_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Abjure_Enemy_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Abjure_Enemy:_Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Abjure Enemy: Frightened (Condition)\">Frighten</a> an enemy. They have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_checks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability checks\">ability checks</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>, and they cannot move. </dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(class_action)\" title=\"Fly (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/40px-Fly_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/60px-Fly_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/80px-Fly_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/40px-Fly_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"m